  "authorNotes": "Showdown / race, 2-4 players, everyone spawns together on the start dock. The first gap is belt-race (400,900 to 700,900, speed 110) — a shared belt all four players fight over, since Showdown legally allows grabbing a rival off it (§8.3); the second gap is a plain swing-race (pivot 970,600, 300px). No assist beams — Showdown is a contest, not a tutorial. goal.requires is 'any': the instant one player's head crosses the goal shape the round ends, matching the round type's 'first to the goal wins'. relic-w2-a sits on the mid counter as an optional detour for the haul/flawless objectives, which score independently of who wins the round."
